            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A deck panel (180) for a retail shelving system (100) is provided. The deck panel includes a panel (181) and a region of strengthening ribbing (214). The panel has a top surface (210) configured for supporting retail merchandise and a bottom surface (212). The region of strengthening ribbing includes a plurality of ribs (217, 218) extending outward from the bottom surface of the panel. The bottom surface of the panel has a border region (240) that extends around the region of strengthening ribbing on at least three sides. The deck panel may be part of a shelf (108) which may be part of a shelving system (100).</p>
            </abstract>
